# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository and in the working copy.
#
# Without this, a clone on Windows with core.autocrlf=true checks out CRLF, and
# testdata/vectors.json stops matching the bytes the generator produces — the
# vectors self-check compares file bytes, so it would fail on a fresh clone for
# a reason that has nothing to do with the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Licence texts are shipped verbatim; never touch them.
LICENSE -text
